  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESILAND CA+ Program Uzbekistan Resilient Landscapes Restoration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Project are (i) to increase the area under sustainable landscape management in Selected Locations in Uzbekistan; and (ii) to promote Uzbekistan&apos;s collaboration with other Central Asian countries on transboundary landscape restoration.</narrative>
  </description>
